OL,3,GNEWSA'He secretly took intimate photos
OL,4,Athen used them to control me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma was 17 when she met a man on a
OL,7,Fdating site. On a video call, she says,
OL,8,Fhe secretly took screenshots of her
OL,9,Fnaked after she had undressed for him.
OL,11,FAccording to Emma, he obtained more
OL,12,Fduring the relationship and threatened
OL,13,Fto share them if she did not do what he
OL,14,Fwanted.
OL,16,F"If I were to end the relationship, he
OL,17,Fwould expose them. If I were to not do
OL,18,Fwhat he said, he would expose them,"
OL,19,Fshe says.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
