OL,3,GNEWSA'He secretly took intimate photos
OL,4,Athen used them to control me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSextortion, or sexual extortion, is
OL,7,Foften associated with demands for
OL,8,Fmoney, but Emma's case shows intimate
OL,9,Fimages can also be used as a means of
OL,10,Fcontrol.
